 "doctype": "Print Format",
 "font_size": 14,
 "html": "<!--\n    Print Format: Acta de Cierre Diario\n    DocType: Fuel Daily Closing\n    Tipo: Custom HTML\n    Nota: clases prefijadas con \"fdc-\" para no chocar con clases de Bootstrap\n    que Frappe carga en el motor de impresi\u00f3n (p. ej. \".label\" es una badge\n    de Bootstrap). Tablas con table-layout:fixed para alinear columnas.\n\n    v4: la diferencia ahora compara el conteo f\u00edsico real (actual_closing_qty,\n    digitado por el supervisor) contra el inventario que calcula el sistema\n    (closing_qty), que es la comparaci\u00f3n que detecta mermas o errores reales.\n-->\n\n<style>\n    * {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    body {\n        font-family: \"Arial\", sans-serif;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: #1a1a1a;\n        background: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-wrapper table {\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-wrapper {\n        width: 100%;\n        max-width: 720px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Header \u2500\u2500 */\n    .fdc-header {\n        background: #1a1a2e;\n        color: #fff;\n        padding: 18px 28px;\n        border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-header td {\n        padding: 0;\n        vertical-align: top;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-brand-name {\n        font-size: 24px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        letter-spacing: 2px;\n        color: #f5a623;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-brand-sub {\n        font-size: 10px;\n        color: #aaa;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        margin-top: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-meta {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-number {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        color: #f5a623;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-date {\n        font-size: 10px;\n        color: #ccc;\n        margin-top: 4px;\n    }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Status bar \u2500\u2500 */\n    .fdc-status-bar {\n        padding: 8px 28px;\n        font-size: 11px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-status-bar.borrador  { background: #f5f5f5; color: #616161; }\n    .fdc-status-bar.cerrado   { background: #e3f2fd; color: #1565c0; }\n    .fdc-status-bar.aprobado  { background: #e8f5e9; color: #1b5e20; }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Cuerpo principal \u2500\u2500 */\n    .fdc-body {\n        border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n        border-top: none;\n        border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;\n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-content {\n        padding: 22px 28px;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-section-title {\n        font-size: 9px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n        color: #9e9e9e;\n        margin-bottom: 10px;\n        padding-bottom: 6px;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-group {\n        margin-bottom: 18px;\n    }\n\n    /* Datos generales: tabla de pares etiqueta/valor, columnas fijas */\n    .fdc-data-table {\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-data-table td {\n        padding: 3px 0;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        vertical-align: top;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-data-table col.lbl { width: 110px; }\n    .fdc-data-table col.val { width: 230px; }\n    .fdc-data-table col.gap { width: 24px; }\n\n    .fdc-lbl {\n        font-size: 10px;\n        color: #757575;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-val {\n        color: #1a1a1a;\n        font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-val.big {\n        font-size: 14px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        color: #1a1a2e;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-val.ok {\n        color: #1b5e20;\n        font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Tarjetas resumen (KPIs) \u2500\u2500 */\n    .fdc-cards {\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-cards td {\n        width: 33.33%;\n        background: #fafafa;\n        border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 12px 8px;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-cards .fdc-spacer {\n        width: 10px;\n        border: none;\n        background: transparent;\n        padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-card-value {\n        font-size: 19px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        color: #1a1a2e;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-card-value.bad { color: #c62828; }\n    .fdc-card-value.ok { color: #1b5e20; }\n\n    .fdc-card-label {\n        font-size: 8px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n        color: #9e9e9e;\n        margin-top: 4px;\n    }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Balance de inventario \u2500\u2500 */\n    .fdc-balance-box {\n        background: #fafafa;\n        border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        padding: 14px 20px;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-balance-table {\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-balance-table col.op  { width: 22px; }\n    .fdc-balance-table col.lbl { width: auto; }\n    .fdc-balance-table col.val { width: 110px; }\n\n    .fdc-balance-table td {\n        padding: 4px 0;\n        font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-balance-table td.fdc-op {\n        color: #9e9e9e;\n        text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-balance-table td.fdc-lbl2 {\n        color: #757575;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        text-transform: none;\n        font-weight: 400;\n        letter-spacing: normal;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-balance-table td.fdc-lbl2.fdc-strong {\n        color: #1a1a2e;\n        font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-balance-table td.fdc-val2 {\n        text-align: right;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        color: #1a1a2e;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-balance-table tr.fdc-total td {\n        border-top: 1px dashed #d0d0d0;\n        padding-top: 9px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-balance-table tr.fdc-diff-row td {\n        border-top: 1px solid #1a1a2e;\n        padding-top: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-balance-table td.fdc-val2.bad { color: #c62828; }\n    .fdc-balance-table td.fdc-val2.ok { color: #1b5e20; }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Tabla de despachos \u2500\u2500 */\n    .fdc-dispatch-table {\n        font-size: 10px;\n        margin-bottom: 4px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-dispatch-table col.c1 { width: 16%; }\n    .fdc-dispatch-table col.c2 { width: 10%; }\n    .fdc-dispatch-table col.c3 { width: 24%; }\n    .fdc-dispatch-table col.c4 { width: 14%; }\n    .fdc-dispatch-table col.c5 { width: 24%; }\n    .fdc-dispatch-table col.c6 { width: 12%; }\n\n    .fdc-dispatch-table th {\n        background: #1a1a2e;\n        color: #f5a623;\n        text-align: left;\n        padding: 7px 8px;\n        font-size: 8.5px;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-dispatch-table th.num {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-dispatch-table td {\n        padding: 6px 8px;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\n        color: #333;\n        overflow: hidden;\n        text-overflow: ellipsis;\n        white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-dispatch-table td.num {\n        text-align: right;\n        font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-dispatch-table tr.alt td {\n        background: #fafafa;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-dispatch-table .fdc-empty td {\n        text-align: center;\n        color: #bdbdbd;\n        font-style: italic;\n        padding: 14px;\n        white-space: normal;\n    }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Notas \u2500\u2500 */\n    .fdc-notes {\n        font-size: 11px;\n        color: #424242;\n        background: #fff8e1;\n        border-left: 3px solid #f5a623;\n        padding: 10px 14px;\n        white-space: pre-wrap;\n    }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Firmas \u2500\u2500 */\n    .fdc-signatures {\n        margin-top: 28px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-signatures td {\n        width: 50%;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding-top: 18px;\n        border-top: 1px solid #757575;\n        vertical-align: top;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-signatures .fdc-sig-gap {\n        width: 30px;\n        border-top: none;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-sig-name {\n        font-size: 11px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        color: #1a1a1a;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-sig-role {\n        font-size: 9px;\n        color: #9e9e9e;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        margin-top: 2px;\n    }\n\n    /* \u2500\u2500 Footer \u2500\u2500 */\n    .fdc-footer {\n        padding: 10px 28px;\n        background: #f5f5f5;\n        border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-footer td {\n        font-size: 9px;\n        color: #757575;\n        vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-footer-uuid {\n        font-size: 8px;\n        color: #bdbdbd;\n        font-family: \"Courier New\", monospace;\n    }\n\n    .fdc-footer-validity {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n\n    @media print {\n        .fdc-wrapper { max-width: 100%; }\n        .fdc-header, .fdc-status-bar, .fdc-dispatch-table th {\n            -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;\n            print-color-adjust: exact;\n        }\n    }\n</style>\n\n{%- set status_class = {\n    \"Borrador\": \"borrador\",\n    \"Cerrado\":  \"cerrado\",\n    \"Aprobado\": \"aprobado\"\n}.get(doc.status, \"borrador\") -%}\n\n{%- set dispatched = doc.get(\"dispatched_qty\") or doc.get(\"salidas_del_d\u00eda\") or doc.total_qty_dispatched or 0 -%}\n{%- set has_physical = doc.actual_closing_qty not in (none, \"\") -%}\n{%- set diff = doc.difference or 0 -%}\n{%- set calc_final = (doc.opening_qty or 0) + (doc.received_qty or 0) - dispatched -%}\n\n<div class=\"fdc-wrapper\">\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <table class=\"fdc-header\">\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <div class=\"fdc-brand-name\">FuelQR</div>\n                <div class=\"fdc-brand-sub\">Acta de Cierre Diario</div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"fdc-meta\">\n                <div class=\"fdc-number\">{{ doc.name }}</div>\n                <div class=\"fdc-date\">Fecha de cierre: {{ frappe.format(doc.date, \"Date\") }}</div>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <!-- Status Bar -->\n    <div class=\"fdc-status-bar {{ status_class }}\">\n        &#9679;&nbsp; {{ doc.status | upper }}\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Body -->\n    <div class=\"fdc-body\">\n        <div class=\"fdc-content\">\n\n            <!-- Datos generales -->\n            <div class=\"fdc-group\">\n                <div class=\"fdc-section-title\">Datos Generales</div>\n                <table class=\"fdc-data-table\">\n                    <colgroup>\n                        <col class=\"lbl\"><col class=\"val\"><col class=\"gap\"><col class=\"lbl\"><col class=\"val\">\n                    </colgroup>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"fdc-lbl\">Estaci\u00f3n</td>\n                        <td class=\"fdc-val big\">{{ doc.station }}</td>\n                        <td></td>\n                        <td class=\"fdc-lbl\">Cerrado por</td>\n                        <td class=\"fdc-val\">{{ frappe.db.get_value(\"User\", doc.closed_by, \"full_name\") or doc.closed_by }}</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"fdc-lbl\">Combustible</td>\n                        <td class=\"fdc-val\">{{ doc.fuel_item or \"Todos\" }}</td>\n                        <td></td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- KPIs -->\n            <div class=\"fdc-group\">\n                <div class=\"fdc-section-title\">Resumen de Despachos</div>\n                <table class=\"fdc-cards\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            <div class=\"fdc-card-value\">{{ doc.total_dispatches or 0 }}</div>\n                            <div class=\"fdc-card-label\">Despachos</div>\n                        </td>\n                        <td class=\"fdc-spacer\"></td>\n                        <td>\n                            <div class=\"fdc-card-value\">{{ \"%.1f\"|format(dispatched) }}</div>\n                            <div class=\"fdc-card-label\">Galones Despachados</div>\n                        </td>\n                        <td class=\"fdc-spacer\"></td>\n                        <td>\n                            <div class=\"fdc-card-value {% if not has_physical %}{% elif diff|abs > 0.5 %}bad{% else %}ok{% endif %}\">\n                                {{ \"%.1f\"|format(diff) if has_physical else \"\u2014\" }}\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"fdc-card-label\">Diferencia (f\u00edsico vs. sistema)</div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Balance de inventario -->\n            <div class=\"fdc-group\">\n                <div class=\"fdc-section-title\">Balance de Inventario (Galones)</div>\n                <div class=\"fdc-balance-box\">\n                    <table class=\"fdc-balance-table\">\n                        <colgroup>\n                            <col class=\"op\"><col class=\"lbl\"><col class=\"val\">\n                        </colgroup>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-op\">&nbsp;</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-lbl2\">Inventario inicial</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-val2\">{{ \"%.1f\"|format(doc.opening_qty or 0) }}</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-op\">+</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-lbl2\">Recepciones del d\u00eda</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-val2\">{{ \"%.1f\"|format(doc.received_qty or 0) }}</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-op\">&minus;</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-lbl2\">Salidas del d\u00eda (tickets despachados)</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-val2\">{{ \"%.1f\"|format(dispatched) }}</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"fdc-total\">\n                            <td class=\"fdc-op\">=</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-lbl2 fdc-strong\">Inventario final \u2014 seg\u00fan sistema</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-val2\">{{ \"%.1f\"|format(doc.closing_qty or 0) }}</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-op\">&nbsp;</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-lbl2 fdc-strong\">Inventario final \u2014 conteo f\u00edsico real</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-val2\">\n                                {{ \"%.1f\"|format(doc.actual_closing_qty) if has_physical else \"Sin registrar\" }}\n                            </td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"fdc-diff-row\">\n                            <td class=\"fdc-op\">&nbsp;</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-lbl2 fdc-strong\">Diferencia (f\u00edsico &minus; sistema)</td>\n                            <td class=\"fdc-val2 {% if not has_physical %}{% elif diff|abs > 0.5 %}bad{% else %}ok{% endif %}\">\n                                {{ \"%.1f\"|format(diff) if has_physical else \"\u2014\" }}\n                            </td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </table>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Detalle de despachos -->\n            <div class=\"fdc-group\">\n                <div class=\"fdc-section-title\">Detalle de Despachos Confirmados</div>\n                <table class=\"fdc-dispatch-table\">\n                    <colgroup>\n                        <col class=\"c1\"><col class=\"c2\"><col class=\"c3\"><col class=\"c4\"><col class=\"c5\"><col class=\"c6\">\n                    </colgroup>\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>Despacho</th>\n                            <th>Hora</th>\n                            <th>Empleado</th>\n                            <th>Veh\u00edculo</th>\n                            <th>Verificaci\u00f3n</th>\n                            <th class=\"num\">Galones</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody>\n                        {%- for row in doc.dispatches %}\n                        <tr class=\"{{ 'alt' if loop.index is even else '' }}\">\n                            <td>{{ row.fuel_dispatch or row.dispatch }}</td>\n                            <td>{{ frappe.format(row.dispatched_at, \"Time\") if row.dispatched_at else \"\u2014\" }}</td>\n                            <td>{{ frappe.db.get_value(\"Employee\", row.employee, \"employee_name\") or row.employee or \"\u2014\" }}</td>\n                            <td>{{ row.vehicle or \"\u2014\" }}</td>\n                            <td>{{ row.identity_method or \"\u2014\" }}</td>\n                            <td class=\"num\">{{ \"%.1f\"|format(row.qty_dispatched or 0) }}</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        {%- else %}\n                        <tr class=\"fdc-empty\">\n                            <td colspan=\"6\">No se registraron despachos en esta fecha y estaci\u00f3n</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        {%- endfor %}\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Notas -->\n            {%- if doc.notes %}\n            <div class=\"fdc-group\">\n                <div class=\"fdc-section-title\">Observaciones</div>\n                <div class=\"fdc-notes\">{{ doc.notes }}</div>\n            </div>\n            {%- endif %}\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Footer -->\n        <table class=\"fdc-footer\">\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"fdc-footer-uuid\">Acta {{ doc.name }} \u00b7 Generada el {{ frappe.utils.now() }}</td>\n                <td class=\"fdc-footer-validity\">\n                    {%- if doc.status == \"Aprobado\" %}\n                        &#10003; Cierre aprobado\n                    {%- elif doc.status == \"Cerrado\" %}\n                        Cierre confirmado, pendiente de aprobaci\u00f3n\n                    {%- else %}\n                        Borrador \u2014 sin validez oficial\n                    {%- endif %}\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n\n    </div>\n\n</div>",
